@BackEnd_HostAddress = http://localhost:5263

### Testar Conexão com a IA (Completion)
POST {{BackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ai/completion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "model": "devQuest",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Olá! Responda apenas: Conexão bem-sucedida!"
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "stream": false
}

